{#- Download links for the current release of a tool. Needs: release (releases.prism or releases.games) -#}
<p>We distribute various pre-built binaries:</p>

<ul>
{%- for p in releases.platforms %}
<li><a href="/dl/{{ release.file }}-{{ release.version }}-{{ p.id }}{{ p.ext }}">{{ release.name }} {{ release.version }} {{ p.label }}</a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>

<p>For non-Windows platforms, it is usually easy to build from source code:</p>

<ul>
<li><a href="/dl/{{ release.file }}-{{ release.version }}-src.tar.gz">{{ release.name }} {{ release.version }} source code</a></li>
<li>See <a href="https://github.com/{{ release.github }}">GitHub</a> for the newest code</li>
</ul>

<p>Older versions are available on the <a href="https://github.com/{{ release.github }}/releases">GitHub releases</a> page.</p>
